 Market food pantry.","source_url":"https://drexel.edu/admissions/virtual-tour/self-guided-walking-tour","source_title":"Self-Guided Walking Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":39.95749,"longitude":-75.18957,"maps_url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=39.95749&mlon=-75.18957#map=19/39.95749/-75.18957","access_notes":"Individual offices and services keep their own schedules and eligibility rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"drexel-first-005","buckets":["college-first-weekend"],"subject_name":"Lancaster Walk orientation loop","subject_type":"sequence_stop","supported_claim":"Lancaster Walk connects major student destinations and provides an outdoor place for community activities and relaxation.","source_url":"https://drexel.edu/admissions/virtual-tour/self-guided-walking-tour","source_title":"Self-Guided Walking Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":39.95802,"longitude":-75.19034,"maps_url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=39.95802&mlon=-75.19034#map=19/39.95802/-75.19034","access_notes":"Outdoor campus route; check event notices for temporary closures.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"drexel-first-006","buckets":["college-first-weekend"],"subject_name":"Drexel Park meetup","subject_type":"sequence_stop","supported_claim":"Drexel Park offers 2.5 acres of open green space for recreation, relaxation, and meeting other people.","source_url":"https://drexel.edu/admissions/visit-tours/dragon-life-tour","source_title":"Dragon Life Tour","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":39.96124,"longitude":-75.18704,"maps_url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=39.96124&mlon=-75.18704#map=19/39.96124/-75.18704","access_notes":"Shared outdoor space serving Drexel and Powelton Village; organized activitie